t up among all overlay roots frozen since the preceding block. A match selects the corresponding retained overlay as a snap-block reconstruction; no match uses ordinary block relay. Ordinary consensus/body validation remains mandatory in both paths. No new block/header consensus field or destination rule is introduced. Conflict policy handling is §8.1; BatchId, stake weighting and consensus changes remain out of scope; the overlay lookup and GBT integration are now in scope.
