+On invalid/matched for outstanding unadmitted x: remove x from Pending,probation,donor and transient assumption records, mark rejected for this height, and emit PeerMisbehaved(invalidBody). Rejected IDs are never fetched or accepted this height, including the conservative collision limitation in§3. No retained session/reference model exists.
