+On notFound or invalid/unbound: mark unavailable only for that donor connection generation and ID; emit bodyNotFound or wrongBodyBinding. Clear x from speculative Ref and place it in global body probation; retain a policyWaiting or FINAL-in decision/reservation for bounded retry, otherwise discard unsupported Pending state. Keep bounded alternate donor identities, not trusted membership. Later claims may trigger an untried donor fetch but cannot restore x to Ref or evidence before actual host admission. Multiple malicious donors cannot restore fake membership after failure.
